A game about fleeing and surviving in a zombie apocalpse
The apocalyspe has just begun, and you're stranded alone in the midst of an unknown city...
You don't know how you got here, but now, you are here and you have to deal with it. 
The zombies seem like they won't stop spawning, and you don't know how much more longer you can still last. 
You're tired... but you refuse to give up. Keep upgrading your gun, and try not to die.
